          "selected": false,
          "text": "The HustlerMarketerCan sell a login page as a movement. Knows a guy at every conference.💡 Ideas🖌️ Craft⚠️ Not a builder: works on products slowly, as a generalist.Hype Machine",
        },
        {
          "disabled": false,
          "selected": false,
          "text": "The OperatorSecurityOwns the checklists, the backups, and the calm voice during outages.🛡️ Rigor🖌️ Craft⚠️ Not a builder: works on products slowly, as a generalist.Steady",
        },
        {
          "disabled": false,
          "selected": false,
          "text": "The ResearcherEngineerLeft a lab to "ship something real". Still reads papers at lunch. Ideas are strange and good.💡 Ideas🧱 BuildingTinkerer",
